  "source_clause_hashes": [
    {
      "sha256": "1f12a8ae4884f5bb77c4e17af2dbed2798f851275d9c97062df43f211a50cee4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- [Required when crossing seams. Strongly recommended otherwise.]"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4fa5085199bb9580ec4aba8e344c9156fc25c08c3f0ad6032d23ad1ba34e1606",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Appetite/cycle:** Read the supplied pitch or accepted framing decision; never"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c2c14fd10fb03bebaa1fa20aaabc15e3bcfcca7872a830c64d8d985dc927f709",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Team and target product:** Use only supplied project context. Unknown ownership"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e08acdebc7f11f78dea95f2fa66ead9a670a764fd23feb2e27f04d00307521e8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Shaping exit criteria:** Apply the selected rubric at shaping depth; do not"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9c1655933ac1952f2c40c6f8d15f790558497fa2073641e829f78cc65c8f8006",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Below the line (stretch):** Only if committed work finishes early"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ded09ee944d3bd722a516ab22ad28d33af9831a4e2f1a70b12b06dbd97ddcfd6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "The skill does NOT maintain an external registry or assume mappings. It only reports what the pitch itself states. If a pitch doesn't name its components, that's a gap flagged in the Architecture dimension."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "01082470313d9a12f3baf5e6bee8af0e1bc27d93accd00d7a3bcd6b7db9b7ea8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- Note team ownership only if stated in the pitch"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3a5a23592da7eec9d3b6961b2c1e52e8cf72be4551f38b94615823d485de7f2c",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- If no seams are crossed: state \"no integration proof required\" with score guidance"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f2e69c2140334091118b73ffb88b54015313f5fcdab805e2f67d494a2f75f31a",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "### Prerequisites (only if architecture is missing)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2cb8c82423bbf65482a53508075b2648530c4be27392436d40b3417e48399932",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "### What You Do NOT Need to Prove"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5d312dddd77f581696db13628a6747490fd04c06b79b147ef15c1a75b0f495ef",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- No seams \u2192 \"Integration proof not required for single-team, single-component work. Score: 8-10 automatic.\""
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d0ce23f12ddf39af7c942e3fce33d27837b0e6a6323a8feab2ecf23036b8682e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "When a pitch names or crosses an architectural seam, the review must inspect an"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bf29230fb1285818a6a6f9176a97e5603c07c846c6e41f538bd3ddfe050d8d9a",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "be `yes` or \"Ready to bet\". The required bundle is:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ead573a8bd8834a0b9557b7828a8848e616f25ccbbd3d39cdea078979c702efc",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| Artifact | Required evidence |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "64a09cb1082cd95762164d6b3968d7d96ff36a643672d4e58fbbc12978ea7dd3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| API / contracts table | Provided and required interfaces, contract state, owner/action, evidence |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8e4345164baf9b101241bdf02c37059c54c4adc7ae14759a79cef5b3db83da12",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "The gate fails closed when a required artifact is absent, unsupported, fabricated,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "687d65ce6dd902141e7025fa0729599f2ef285aa0f620515b61323b814fa7bf1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "or marked only as an unverified assumption. A `blocked` placement can remain a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "79c1cd99a42834618c9b2dea2d0cc6ba8ae4edb9cf3e005f0f52af17c6da6fc1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "named rabbit hole only when the review records the exact human/platform step,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6be5aa23d8cfc0a7eb5036a58230ebf77eca269ad92aebf4db4a6135ec00ec01",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "that does not cross an architectural seam may omit the bundle only if the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7d7152ffce5d7a21a2e0b80f49631cd126a7d85241a90755088b96ac0fdc1005",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "prerequisite, not a new weighted score. The review output must report:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7ed7ec38d6ca94a53202def3053b7ec90ca2e7ebb8398214e5583bb72a802e30",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- each required artifact's authoring, render, and placement status"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "71b7e2d1094852a967b41a82ffe668f3b91de49a2929a0ec73e321bec4fd2eed",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| Contract State | What It Means | What the Pitch Must Show |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "cdbe1dcbd0f8607242a7abb2652ce32cb7ed7069a9b0db9becc21abd57d6015f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| **Does not exist** | No contract/API defined between these areas | Must work with owning team to define contract BEFORE betting. Spike proving the seam works. Score depends on progress. |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1c74a6e1a201be8668c0ea714dd6b8c83e862ced48c1f66400cfd47a3007f9b8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **1-2:** Title only or one-liner."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8122b0b659dc140ffca0b213f06e07af2646032a4b0e300ff07dbc519bae9e59",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **no** = Empty, title-only, or just a problem statement with no shaping."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a24e26f1e6ab71b90d217e56d01503aea468125d80688a3c7b2e066a3621641e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "**Key rule:** If rabbit holes are listed but not resolved (no answers, no owners, no evidence of investigation), the pitch is `partial` regardless of other scores. Rabbit hole resolution is a shaping exit criterion \u2014 they must be addressed DURING shaping, not deferred to build."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d678721563279d04b01868241f2a4d964146a93a98196428c393480d8fa4ea6c",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- Verdict must match shaped status. A `partial` pitch CANNOT have a \"ready to bet\" verdict."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "fe96762105acda5e852f2bfb890230dab147ba94771de1b405f27452e4f5cc7f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Acceptable** only when the pitch explicitly explains why Product participation"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ad96b6efc4f26c8510e5ec676d05bc1c6ee5cc3bdf4131216833f56d88b3b8da",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "is not required and identifies the person or role with authority over the problem,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5772c336924c3a9029d790c9f4d2ef7e9fa41c7fbe0fd94464aad016842034e3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Next actions must be specific to THIS pitch.** Not generic template advice. If the advice could apply to any pitch without modification, it doesn't belong in the review."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bbfde09aa596af6b19a1188bf1ea48ba4adf45e24c055af1dae3fce8ce893743",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Scores must be consistent.** The same pitch reviewed twice must produce the same score. If appetite-scaling changes the score, note why."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "## Required Output"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e65ea8fc2cdb5df64f038f8b02ccce37374a4aad3ffca08cd953aa1ee10f07ba",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- What you do NOT need to prove"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "940e8b557bbd00643abfbdf3ac5e0fcfe0473c8df94372f26bed0c1a672659b8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Current evidence:** None (code-level research only)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2cb8c82423bbf65482a53508075b2648530c4be27392436d40b3417e48399932",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "### What You Do NOT Need to Prove"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3f409f81bf498a3744f2f94a21c81d8972f254564b5b010e550d0e3b03e1f203",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| Verdict matches shaped status | `partial` never says \"ready to bet\" | Mismatch |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d267c1f0186bb6e7a2decf8b4e1917b3d52c43d984f5d5666b7966f16f7045b1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "| Component extraction accurate | Only reports what the pitch states | Invents or assumes mappings |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8862702a682ef182057d03212b0f4a8b9914bae7c26beb903bbc3a43c7bf02bb",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "- **Forbidden:** Write directly to the delivery tracker spreadsheet. Change pitch priority or goal mapping without user approval. Approve pitches for betting (that's leadership's call)."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7c1abbd4f7b26cd9e35f9516a7f552784c20e9973bbad8138ba72805958bbe68",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "for that mode only. The actual human appetite and current evidence override the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "95f76c66d454e7435eee0d91799935db050d0b1c6c57c0f462b43535949d7913",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "historical four-week/team assumptions in examples and context. Required three"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2fa57cd93caf9c46329210af42fd6a35952cab6a209ee527aff49d778a356880",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "Rabbit holes require sourced mitigations; do not demand a finished implementation"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "99b3fadaa7eb56b501767aa23138306659308fe3f00d1d8bb8c16dd040e75506",
      "source": "ssot/engos-audit-pitch-review.md",
      "text": "missing owner, unresolved material question or required artifact."
    }
  ],
